  "about": "The tools code mods are built with and the native build patch tool, pinned and checksummed: Zig compiles mods; CMake and Ninja are for IDEs that open a mod as a CMake project; hpatchz-linux applies Steam build patches on Linux. Fetched into tools/ by scripts/Setup-ModTools.ps1 (the repository) or HellForge.Cli mod-tools (an installation). Platform says which host runs the tool: zig compiles Windows sessions, zig-linux compiles source mods on a Linux host before its session, and hpatchz-linux patches a Linux installation without starting Proton for each file.",
